# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# .env.dev.example  —  LEGACY FILE, no longer the source of truth
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# This file existed in the previous configuration system (.env.*).
# All non-secret values it contained have been migrated to:
#
#   params/base/params.yml       ← shared defaults
#   params/dev/params.yml        ← development overrides
#
# The only values that should be in an .env file are secrets:
#
#   API_KEY, OPENROUTER_API_KEY, TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN, SUPABASE_*, etc.
#
# Copy the secrets template with:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# This file can be safely deleted.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════


# Development Settings
APP_ENV=dev
APP_DEBUG=True
LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG
RELOAD=True

# Development Server
HOST=127.0.0.1
PORT=8000

# LLM Configuration (set one)
# If using OpenRouter:
LLM_PROVIDER=openrouter
LLM_MODEL=meta-llama/llama-3.1-70b-instruct
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your-openrouter-key-here

# If using OpenAI:
# LLM_PROVIDER=openai
# LLM_MODEL=gpt-4-turbo
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-key-here

# LLM - Fallback key (if not using provider-specific keys)
# LLM_API_KEY=your-api-key-here

# Optional: Telegram (development mode with polling)
# TELEGRAM_ENABLED=False
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=your-dev-bot-token

# Optional: Supabase
# SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key

# Development Features
MCP_ENABLED=False
ENABLE_STRUCTURED_LOGS=False

# ─── Security (relaxed for dev) ────────────────────────────────────────────
API_KEY_ENABLED=false
# API_KEY=my-dev-api-key
CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://localhost:8000

# Telegram allowlist — leave empty to allow all users in dev
TELEGRAM_ALLOWED_USER_IDS=

# ─── Execution Limits ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
MAX_MODEL_CALLS_PER_TURN=5
MAX_TOOL_CALLS_PER_TURN=20
MAX_AGENT_TURNS=1000
MAX_INPUT_CHARS=8000
MAX_OUTPUT_CHARS=12000
AGENT_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=60
ENABLE_METRICS=False
ALLOW_AGENT_REGISTRATION=True
